# Machine Learning Solutions

Welcome to my Machine Learning repository! 👋

This repository contains my solutions to various Machine Learning problems and projects. It is a collection of my practice work, assignments, and experiments as I learn and explore different ML concepts.

## 📂 Contents

* Data Preprocessing
* Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
* Linear Regression
* Logistic Regression
* Classification
* Clustering
* Model Evaluation
* Other Machine Learning algorithms and projects

## 🛠️ Tools & Libraries

* Python
* NumPy
* Pandas
* Matplotlib
* Scikit-learn
* Jupyter Notebook / Google Colab

## 🎯 Purpose

* Practice Machine Learning concepts.
* Build hands-on projects.
* Keep all ML solutions in one place.
* Track my learning progress.

More problems and solutions will be added as I continue learning.

⭐ Feel free to explore the repository!
